SCOPE

This covers the site's source — markup, styles, scripts and the brand assets
authored in this repository.

Sim clips, plots and metrics shown on the page are **not** stored here. They
are fetched at deploy time from the `sim-latest` release of
https://github.com/MikePaNtZ/overboard, which is MIT under its own LICENSE and
carries its own third-party attribution for the vendored Openwheel meshes.
